658CA41C584E6FCF0000026FB0284DDC,0,Melee weapons are powerful hand-to-hand weapons capable of targeting a single cell in any direction. They require cooldown and can affect more than one enemy.
658CA41C584E6FCF0000027042F5F7EB,0,Mario casts a BIG shadow - anyone close enough will do extra  damage with their weapons just for sharing his spotlight.
658CA41C584E6FCF000002714CF08601,0,"STOMP JUMP an enemy to cause damage, then leap to the safety of an empty cell - all while exercising your glutes."
658CA41C584E71FB00000278DF714795,0,Once you target an enemy with one of these it will do its best to pursue until it explodes on contact - regardless of how many turns it takes. Setting down a second will cause the first one to explode instantly.
658CA41C584E71FB0000027923D3C163,0,All Heroes in range benefit from therapeutic healing effects - like throwing a wellness party in your own private spa!
658CA41C584E71FB0000027A911ABF86,0,"You've heard of Dash? Well, this is DOUBLE DASH and it kicks butt! Perform up to TWO Dashes in a single move. Why settle for less?"
658CA41C584E73000000028F673A91F6,0,"Needs a clear line of fire but once it hits its mark, provides a DEVASTATING area attack damaging all enemies within range. Requires cooldown, has drop off."
658CA41C584E7300000002902FBFD85D,0,Enemies in range will find their weapon attacks just became weaker than a kitten.
658CA41C584E7300000002913FE87F1B,0,"Dashing at an enemy is fun, but fleeting. Why not make a LASTING impression with VAMP DASH? Drains enemy health, not your wallet!"
658CA41C584E733700000298DB19C7F6,0,Once you target an enemy with one of these it will do its best to pursue until it explodes on contact - regardless of how many turns it takes. Setting down a second will cause the first one to explode instantly.
658CA41C584E733700000299C9457AB6,0,All Heroes in range will have their Area of Movement extended - perfect for making sure the rear of the battlefield is in okay shape.
658CA41C584E73370000029A1FFBA4DF,0,Enjoy jumping but dislike deciding where to land? Relax - DOUBLE JUMP allows up to TWO team jumps in a single move. Impress your friends!
658CA41C584E7365000002A14C386A91,0,Melee weapons are powerful hand-to-hand weapons capable of targeting a single cell in any direction. They require cooldown and can affect more than one enemy.
658CA41C584E7365000002A27895664E,0,"All you have to do is dance, and enemies in range will come running faster than dogs after a jogger wearing pizza-scented underwear."
658CA41C584E7365000002A3407C5298,0,"Why settle for average! Make a splash with BOOM DASH by distributing damage over an area, so multiple enemies can feel the wallop in your gallop."
658CA41C584E73B6000002AAE0004326,0,Enemies better duck! This weapon bounces at its target for a devastating area attack. Requires cooldown and has drop off.
658CA41C584E73B6000002AB06C4B7BE,0,Enemies within range will do less damage to Heroes who stay close enough to Princess Peach.
658CA41C584E73B6000002AC78DDDF2B,0,"Want to float more than your boat? Heroes everywhere are talking about FLOATY JUMP, the latest breakthrough in jump extension technology."
658CA41C584E73EB000002B3223ADCAF,0,"Needs a clear line of fire but once it hits its mark, it provides a DEVASTATING area attack that damages enemies within range. Requires cooldown, has drop off."
658CA41C584E73EB000002B4A9FE6E8F,0,"Like that famous, city-destroying dinosaur of the Far East, your cry will send any foe in range running for the hills."
658CA41C584E73EB000002B56361F4B9,0,Tired of single dashes that do less than impress? TRIPLE DASH allows up to THREE per move! That's triple the value - at less than triple the price.
658CA41C584E7416000002BCAFC8E99A,0,"Needs a clear line of fire but once it hits its mark, it provides a DEVASTATING area attack that damages enemies within range. Requires cooldown, has drop off."
658CA41C584E7416000002BD32F05D68,0,Enemies are much more likely to be on the receiving end of a Super Effect when you have a little luck on your side.
658CA41C584E7416000002BE5251BE73,0,"Is it an earthquake? A volcano? It's YOU - when you bring the 'hammer' down using GROUND POUND, and deliver damage to every enemy within an area."
